# Walnut Labs baseline .gitignore — copy to `.gitignore` when scaffolding a repo,
# then append the stack-specific block from templates/README.md.

# ── macOS Finder metadata ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Not cosmetic. Finder rewrites .DS_Store whenever a folder is opened, so a repo
# that tracks one is permanently dirty — and the rules auto-pull deliberately
# SKIPS any repo with uncommitted changes, so it silently stops fast-forwarding.
# Agents then read stale rules with nothing to indicate anything is wrong.
.DS_Store

# ── Editor and tooling scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# ── Local environment ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Credentials live in CI variables and in the developer's own environment, never
# in the repo. The committed example documents the shape without the values.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Node / web ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
out/
.npm/
*.log

# ── Local app state when run from the repo ───────────────────────────────────
.weft-data/
*.tsbuildinfo
.drive-shots/
